      "claim": "No traffic advisory covers the Bedok Interchange PHV bay in this window - the artifact is MISSING with weight 0.0 - so POL-NS-06 limb (i) is unavailable and the driver cannot accumulate dwell across intervals or excuse the shortfall on kerb-restriction grounds.",
      "side": "RIDER",
